66 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (Managing personal finances effectively is becoming increasingly important, particularly for students and young professionals who are beginning to handle income, expenses, savings, investments, loans, and financial goals independently. Despite having access to digital payment and budgeting tools, many individuals struggle to maintain consistent saving habits, control unnecessary spending, remember upcoming bills, and plan their finances according to long-term objectives. Financial decisions are often made without a clear understanding of how current spending and saving patterns affect future goals.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
67 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (A major gap exists in the availability of a single, user-friendly platform that goes beyond basic expense tracking and provides personalized financial guidance and motivation. Existing solutions often focus mainly on recording transactions or displaying expenses, while users may still lack support in maintaining saving discipline, identifying suitable opportunities to increase their income, receiving timely alerts, or understanding possible investment options. There is also limited integration of motivational elements such as progress tracking, streaks, rewards, and personalized recommendations that can encourage users to consistently follow their financial plans.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
68 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (Our project aims to bridge this gap by providing a personalized financial planning platform that helps users manage their money while staying motivated toward their financial goals. The system is designed to provide goal-oriented planning, savings and spending tracking, alerts, reminders, progress and streak monitoring, and personalized recommendations based on the user's financial profile, interests, and qualifications. It also introduces reward-based motivation through milestone achievements and coupons, along with recommendations for suitable side-income opportunities and potential financial options. In this way, the platform aims to make personal financial management more structured, engaging, and goal-oriented.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
69 0 obj
<<
